  {"source":
   {"file": "blueprint/spaces/compact/between.md", "anonymous": false},
   "kind": "hidden",
   "id": "compact-between",
   "depth": 0,
   "boundary": [],
   "body":
   "Passing to complements turns open covers into families of closed sets, and\n\"has no finite subcover\" into \"has the finite intersection property\".  The\nnext theorem records this.",
   "attrs": {"order": 2}},
  {"source": {"file": "blueprint/appendix/_section.md", "anonymous": false},
   "kind": "appendix",
   "id": "conventions",
   "depth": 0,
